# What must never enter a build context.
#
# Not only about upload size: `web/Dockerfile` and `stills/Dockerfile` copy
# their sources *after* `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`, so a local
# `node_modules/` would be laid over the freshly installed tree and produce a
# silently wrong image.

.git/
.gitignore

# Rust build output — gigabytes, and the wrong architecture half the time.
target/
api/target/

# Node
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
dist/
**/dist/
.pnpm-store/

# Secrets stay on the machine that holds them (§15).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local state
infra/backups/
*.log
.claude/
